  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru COVID-19 Vaccination Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project will focus on the procurement of COVID-19 vaccines to further implement the COVID-19 vaccination plan in Peru. The project will build on the experiences and achievements of similar project under implementation in the region and around the world. The project will have one technical component that will support the procurement of COVID-19 vaccines, and a Project management component.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase COVID-19 vaccination coverage among the population of Peru.</narrative>
  </description>
